A publish without a collection or photos, as the plugin sends for a
deleted collection, marks deleted the notes of the collections the
service no longer has, both of them when two claim one (A and B):
lightroom-deleted replaces lightroom-collection and lightroom-path, and
each note becomes a draft. Other.md, of a collection that remains, is
untouched.
-- request.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"op": "publish",
	"service": [
		{
			"id": 13,
			"path": [
				"Other"
			]
		}
	]
}
-- vault/Galleries/A.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 11
lightroom-path: Trips/New Zealand
---

Text.
-- vault/Galleries/B.md --
---
vaultsite-draft: false
lightroom-collection: 11
lightroom-path: "2024: Spring"
tags:
  - trip
---
-- vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
Sunset
-- vault/Galleries/Other.md --
---
lightroom-collection: 13
lightroom-path: Other
---
-- want/response.json --
{
	"protocol": 5
}
-- want/log --
marked Galleries/A.md deleted
marked Galleries/B.md deleted
marked Galleries/Recent.md deleted
-- want/vault/Galleries/A.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-deleted: Trips/New Zealand
vaultsite-draft: true
---

Text.
-- want/vault/Galleries/B.md --
---
vaultsite-draft: true
lightroom-deleted: "2024: Spring"
tags:
  - trip
---
-- want/vault/Galleries/Other.md --
---
lightroom-collection: 13
lightroom-path: Other
---
-- want/vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-deleted: Recent
vaultsite-draft: true
---

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
Sunset
